      "description": "Header and bottom-bar styling; panel preview stays in normal flow.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Preview navigation\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#journal\"><svg class=\"ds-nav-icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14m0-14C9 4 5 4 2 5v14c3-1 7-1 10 2 3-3 7-3 10-2V5c-3-1-7-1-10 2Z\"/></svg>Journal</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#review\"><svg class=\"ds-nav-icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg>Add review</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:4px}.ds-nav-link{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:9px;color:var(--color-muted,#676773);font-size:13px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .18s,color .18s;font-family:var(--font-journal-sans,\"DM Sans\",sans-serif);}.ds-nav-link:hover{background:#efedf7;color:var(--color-accent,#565c9c)}.ds-nav-link[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:#e9e9fb;color:var(--color-accent,#565c9c);font-weight:700}.ds-nav-link:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--color-accent,#565c9c);outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:1000px){.ds-nav{justify-content:center;background:var(--color-paper,#faf9f5);border-top:1px solid var(--color-line,#dfdfe5);padding:8px 16px}.ds-nav-link{flex:1;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;max-width:180px;min-height:54px;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 8px;font-size:12px}.ds-nav-link[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:transparent}.ds-nav-link[aria-current=\"page\"] .ds-nav-icon{background:#e6e7fb;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #e6e7fb}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav-link{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Metadata badge",
